@benchmark AuditOverhead_Enabled @gate AC-16: SERIALIZABLE isolation overhead as audit-path proxy.
Full audit logging is exercised via the TransactionAuditor component (see bench_transaction_throughput.cpp). This benchmark provides an isolation-level overhead proxy for the phase 4 gate.
@benchmark DistributedThroughput_2PC_3Participants @gate AC-17: Distributed 2PC throughput (begin → prepare → commit).
